[I] Library for discovering Python interpreters

[T] Python-discovery is a library for discovering Python interpreters installed
[T] on your machine. You may have multiple Python versions from system packages,
[T] pyenv, mise, asdf, uv, or the Windows registry (PEP 514). This library finds
[T] the right one for you.

[U] https://virtualenvwrapper.readthedocs.io/

